WEBVTT

00:00:07.779 --> 00:00:10.571
<v><b>Kim:</b></v> The yard’s wonderful, I love it.

00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:12.250
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> Is there a garage?

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:16.104
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> Oh yes, there’s a big garage over there.

00:00:16.988 --> 00:00:20.897
<v><b>Kim:</b></v> You lived in this house, is that right, Mrs. …?

00:00:20.922 --> 00:00:22.730
<v><b>Barbara	:</b></v> Miss Travers.

00:00:23.393 --> 00:00:25.086
But call me Barbara, dear.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:31.794
Yes, I lived here. A long time ago. Now I live in town.

00:00:32.772 --> 00:00:34.886
Let’s go inside the house…

00:00:40.408 --> 00:00:46.684
This is the living room. It’s a lovely room, very bright.

00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:53.798
<v><b>Kim:</b></v> Mmm... I love the furniture, the old sofa, the armchairs, the fireplace.

00:00:56.131 --> 00:00:58.858
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> And this is the library…

00:00:59.310 --> 00:01:01.985
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> Wow! There’s a library, Kim!

00:01:05.334 --> 00:01:07.722
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> And this is the kitchen.

00:01:08.384 --> 00:01:11.160
It’s very big, as you can see.

00:01:11.589 --> 00:01:13.297
<v><b>Kim:</b></v> Is there a dishwasher?

00:01:13.659 --> 00:01:18.110
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> No, there isn’t. It’s an old house, you see.

00:01:18.658 --> 00:01:23.742
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> Never mind. I think it’s nice. Is there a bathroom downstairs?

00:01:24.215 --> 00:01:29.528
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> Yes, there’s one downstairs and there are three upstairs.

00:01:30.472 --> 00:01:32.836
<v><b>Kim:</b></v> Are there any neighbors with children?

00:01:33.095 --> 00:01:36.634
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> No, there aren’t any neighbors near here.

00:01:37.105 --> 00:01:40.405
But there are some families with children in town.

00:01:40.882 --> 00:01:43.677
<v><b>Kim:</b></v> That’s great. We have two children.

00:01:43.994 --> 00:01:48.853
<v><b>Barbara	:</b></v> Very nice, dear. Now, let’s go upstairs…